  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Angry White Men takes its title from a phrase used to describe the 1994 mid-term electorate that put Newt Gingrich's Republican House in power, said to have been motviated by "God, Guns and Gays." This became a starting point for my investigation of the shifting of the political center point as well as a look into the darker side of extremists and their motivations"--Author's Web site.</subfield>
